ques, such as structured content and schema markup, also benefit traditional search rankings.</p></div></div></div><div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><h3 itemprop="name">What metrics should be tracked to measure GEO success?</h3><div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"><div itemprop="text"><p>Key GEO metrics include AI engine citation frequency, brand mention accuracy across AI responses, competitive positioning in AI-generated answers, and conversion rates from AI-driven traffic sources.</p></div></div></div></div>
